      "description": "Native Dark row and on switch; fixed-state visual sample, not a working preference control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-toggle-on\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-toggle-on-copy\"><strong>Reduced motion</strong><span>Turn off desktop window and workspace animations when you save.</span></span><span class=\"ds-toggle-on-state\">On</span><span class=\"ds-toggle-on-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-toggle-on{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;width:100%;padding:16px 12px;border:2px solid #080D12;border-radius:10px;background:#080D12;color:#D8E5EC;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;}.ds-toggle-on:hover{background:#17212B;}.ds-toggle-on:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#49D7E8;}.ds-toggle-on-copy{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}.ds-toggle-on-copy strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}.ds-toggle-on-copy>span,.ds-toggle-on-state{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#A8BAC7;}.ds-toggle-on-track{box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;flex-shrink:0;width:44px;height:26px;padding:0 3px;border-radius:999px;background:#49D7E8;}.ds-toggle-on-track>span{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#080D12;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Save footer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "save-footer",
      "description": "Native footer visual sample with explicit status and save/undo actions; it sits outside scrolling content.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-footer\"><span class=\"ds-footer-status\">Preview · not saved</span><button class=\"ds-footer-undo\">Undo</button><button class=\"ds-footer-save\">Save changes</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 24px;background:#080D12;border-top:1px solid #364957;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#A8BAC7;}.ds-footer-status{flex:1;}.ds-footer-undo{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;box-sizing:border-box;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:2px solid #364957;border-radius:10px;background:#17212B;color:#D8E5EC;cursor:pointer;}.ds-footer-undo:hover:not(:disabled){opacity:.85;}.ds-footer-undo:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px dashed #49D7E8;}.ds-footer-undo:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default;}.ds-footer-save{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;box-sizing:border-box;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:2px solid #49D7E8;border-radius:10px;background:#49D7E8;color:#080D12;cursor:pointer;}.ds-footer-save:hover:not(:disabled){opacity:.85;}.ds-footer-save:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px dashed #080D12;}.ds-footer-save:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inline write error",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "inline-error",
      "description": "Native error-band styling with current permission-recovery copy; the sample directory is illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-error\"><span class=\"ds-error-copy\">Cannot write settings in ~/.config/crowbaros. Restore write permission for your account, then choose Save changes again.</span><button class=\"ds-error-reload\">Reload saved</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-error{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 24px;background:#080D12;border-top:1px solid #364957;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#D8E5EC;}.ds-error-copy{flex:1;}.ds-error-reload{flex-shrink:0;}.ds-error-reload{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;box-sizing:border-box;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:2px solid #364957;border-radius:10px;background:#17212B;color:#D8E5EC;cursor:pointer;}.ds-error-reload:hover:not(:disabled){opacity:.85;}.ds-error-reload:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px dashed #49D7E8;}.ds-error-reload:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default;}"
    },
    {
